# Frozen-files manifest — TEMPLATE. Copy to `frozen-files.manifest` (repo root)
# and list this project's own generated or frozen paths, one per line.
#
# A path belongs here when a hand-edit would silently invalidate a hash,
# signature, freeze snapshot, or receipt chain the file anchors. The guard
# (scripts/check_frozen_files.py) fails closed when any listed path appears in
# the diff, so an edit is caught before it lands rather than discovered later.
#
# Rules:
# - Paths are repo-relative, exactly as `git diff --name-only` prints them.
# - Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
# - This list is project-specific. Never ship a real project's manifest inside
#   a shared skill bundle — only this .example template travels.
#
# Examples (replace with your project's real frozen paths):
evidence/frozen/example-final-freeze.json
evidence/receipts/example-run-receipt.json
reports/generated/example-rollup.csv
